{
  "id": 1401,
  "description": "# Welcome in Exiles of None\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nNO REQUIREMENTS FOR JOINING EXCEPT BEING A CURSED/BANISHED CLASS\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n### 🌐Guild Network🌐\n\n🔸Main Guild: Masters of None🔸\n\n🔸Banished/Cursed Guild: Exiles of None🔸\n\n🔸Alt Guilds: Seekers of None, Adepts of None, Elites of None🔸\n\nWe use the following Guild structure for Players to progress trough and provide a suitable Guild for every Player/Combat Level:\n\n🔸CL 1-40 -&gt;  Seekers of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 40-60 -&gt; Adepts of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 60-80 -&gt; Elites of None🔸\n\n🔸CL (70) 80-100 -&gt; Masters of None🔸\n\nPlease join the Guild appropiate for you CL.\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### ⚔️Raids⚔️\n\nRaid Schedule Timezone: CET/UTC+1\n\nNo Raids planned.\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### 📦Stockpile📦\n\nOnly contribute Logs and Bars. Longterm Goal is to have 30K from every Ressource.\n\nCurrent Material priority for the next Building Slot:\n\nLogs: -\n\nMetal Bars: -\n\n( Every other Resource is obviously fine too )\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### 📞Discord📞\n\nFor those interested here is a Discordlink for the Guild Server: https://discord.gg/qBBPgk8zyZ\n\nRecommended for:\n\n🔸Information and Resources like Tools and Calculators\n\n🔸Raid/World Boss/Shrine alerts\n\n🔸Take part in Decisions, shaping the future of the Guilds\n\n🔸Ask us Questions regarding the Guilds or Game there\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════",
